rooms_desc ({"Climbing the steps, you arrive on Cashmere's front porch.  You see severalchairs and a comfortable swing on her wrap-around porch.  The whiterailing extends around two sides of the house, shaping the large baywindow in the corner of the house.  A small mailbox is here, and a doorbell.  You notice the arrangements of flowers and smell theirsweet aroma.","This is the main hall.  It is very wide, and has high cielings, you wonderwhy it didn't look like this from the outside, the interior is unique.There are large ancient pillars lining the hall, three on each side.There are large comfortable chairs and sofas to sit on, beautifultables with various objects on them, and plants scattered about the room.You notice the living space to the east, the kitchen to the west,and a large door to the north.","This is a bedroom.  You can have passionate sex here.  Cashmerebelieves in safe sex.  She has a basket of condoms bythe bed.  There are candles all around the room and soft musicis coming from speakers in the walls.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
